{
  "description": "The runtime directory of ADR 0021, section 2, chosen from the platform, XDG_RUNTIME_DIR, LOCALAPPDATA and the uid. The Rust runtime (crates/ipc/src/paths.rs) and the Python client (harness/orchestration/runtime_client.py) both pass every case; a null directory is a refusal.",
  "cases": [
    {
